{"text": "winderlea\n\nvineyard and winery\n\ndy\nD Villametic\n\nXe\n\nPINOT NOIR\n\nThe 2018 Willamette Valley is, through and\nthrough, a precise reflection of the vintage\nfrom which it came. The aromatics of the\nwine are dusty and fruity with smashed\nraspberries, cedar chips, and a hint of\nfresh-rain-on-concrete. This swirls and\nevolves to show blackberry leaf, rooibos\ntea, and hibiscus. The nose has energy and\nnerve with a fresh, light quality that\ntranslates to a mellow and soft flavor.\nWatermelon, cocoa, and chocolate covered\ncherries spread out on an even and\nbalanced palate that has poignant acidity\nand chalky-fine tannins. The wine is robust\nbut not big, full but not heavy, and lingers\nlong enough to carry you to the next sip.\n\nVineyards: Crawford Beck (24%), Weber\n(25%), Shea (25%), Meredith\nMitchell (26%)\nAVA: Willamette Valley\nHarvest Dates: 9.28 - 10.3.18\n\nAging: 10 months in neutral\nFrench oak barrels\n\nFinished Alcohol: 13.5%\nBottling Date: 8.27.19\n\nCase Production: 264\n\n\\\n\n\u00ae\n\nwinderlea\n\nvineyard and winery\n\n201 Ly\nD Villemetic\n\nDX\nPINOT NOIR\n\nThe 2018 Willamette Valley is, through and\nthrough, a precise reflection of the vintage\nfrom which it came. The aromatics of the\nwine are dusty and fruity with smashed\nraspberries, cedar chips, and a hint of\nfresh-rain-on-concrete. This swirls and\nevolves to show blackberry leaf, rooibos\ntea, and hibiscus. The nose has energy and\nnerve with a fresh, light quality that\ntranslates to a mellow and soft flavor.\nWatermelon, cocoa, and chocolate covered\ncherries spread out on an even and\nbalanced palate that has poignant acidity\nand chalky-fine tannins. The wine is robust\nbut not big, full but not heavy, and lingers\nlong enough to carry you to the next sip\n\nVineyards: Crawford Beck (24%), Weber\n(25%), Shea (25%), Meredith\nMitchell (26%)\nAVA: Willamette Valley\nHarvest Dates: 9.28 - 10.3.18\n\n10 months in neutral\nFrench oak barrels\n\nAgin,\n\nFinished Alcohol: 13.5%\n\nBottling Date: 8.27.19\n\nCase Production: 264\n\nNN",
